sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Service
    participant DB as MongoDB

    Note over S,DB: Transaction starts - snapshot, majority, 5 s deadline
    S->>DB: insert redemption
    alt duplicate key on key or active order
        DB-->>S: E11000
        S->>DB: abort
        S->>DB: re-run R1 and R2 once
        S-->>C: committed outcome or 503 RETRYABLE_ERROR
    else inserted
        S->>DB: coupon update if ACTIVE, in window, usedCount below totalLimit
        alt no document matched
            S->>DB: abort, then re-read coupon
            S-->>C: 409 TOTAL_LIMIT_REACHED or 422 NOT_REDEEMABLE
        else matched
            S->>DB: customer usage upsert if usedCount below limit
            alt E11000 on the upsert
                S->>DB: abort
                S-->>C: 409 CUSTOMER_LIMIT_REACHED
            else ok
                S->>DB: commit
                S-->>C: 201 redemption
            end
        end
    end
    Note over S,DB: WriteConflict at any step - abort, wait 5 to 25 ms, rerun until the deadline, then 503
